      "name": "snap_router",
      "description": "Tool/service DISCOVERY, not execution. Input: an agent task in plain words. Output: a ranked shortlist of x402 services and MCP tools from the merged x402 Bazaar + MCP Registry catalog (16k+ entries) that can do it, each with price and a 'works well with' hint. One vector pass, ~200ms, no LLM call, hybrid keyword-fill so nothing is missed. Call this FIRST, before loading candidate tools into context, whenever you do not already know which tool serves a task. Example task: 'check a Base token for a honeypot before trading'.",
